<title>FRANCE: Non-residents net sellers French bonds in March.</title>
<headline>Non-residents net sellers French bonds in March.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Figures released by the finance ministry showed non-resident investors sold a net 10.76 billion francs of French government bonds (OATs and BTANs) in March.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following unadjusted breakdown (in billions of francs) of the financial account in its balance of payment figures.</p>
<p>						  March   Feb    March 96</p>
<p> DIRECT INVESTMENT			 -4.76    -5.80   -6.91</p>
<p>     - French investment abroad     -13.83    -5.36  -17.27</p>
<p>     - foreign investment in France   9.07    -0.44   10.36</p>
<p> PORTFOLIO INVESTMENT		   -51.00    -7.90  -75.76</p>
<p>  Residents in foreign securities   -39.98   -24.01  -47.05</p>
<p>     - shares				10.58    -2.43    4.81</p>
<p>     - bonds				-41.93   -21.35  -29.47</p>
<p>     - money market instruments     -10.83     0.20  -22.49</p>
<p>     - derivative products		2.20    -0.43    0.10</p>
<p>  Non-residents in French securities-11.02    16.11  -28.71</p>
<p>     - shares				-0.74    12.43    7.62</p>
<p>     - bonds				 -3.92     6.87  -34.73</p>
<p>     - govt securities(OATs, BTANs) -10.76     3.47  -27.44</p>
<p>     - money market instruments	-6.36    -3.19   -1.60</p>
<p> OTHER INVESTMENTS			 36.46    13.86   80.86</p>
<p> - Credits				   14.88    61.85   43.03</p>
<p> - Liabilities			     21.58   -48.00   37.83</p>
<p> RESERVE ASSETS			    -4.69    -4.25   -0.05</p>
<p> TOTAL FINANCIAL ACCOUNT		-24.00    -4.08   -1.86</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
